WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
The window shows the session greet

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:10.300
In the session buffer, C-c C-t lists the sessions, and typing narrows them to notes

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:14.600
The window now shows notes, and its tab is selected

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:18.100
C-c C-t again, back to greet

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:20.400
greet is back in the window
